ygrdQCBRktrVLwjp2TA2J0ec0_JfYg&oe=6B10356D"}, {"file_name": "Mech bay.png", "id": "1701930173984980", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568672_1701930177318313_8261861773708530690_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VbpgnjOQHi4Q7kNvwGlefdg&_nc_oc=AdogvhMlVaSOVArOZ4KB6zAYjM8C3NrdLvLffXsB926Dkph2za9Kjf7O6HxuigQZgFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW4nAt1I_qLsSjC-dN_Ey3tKxIq-xNjp3aGg4-rGdiDhA&oe=6B104FE0"}, {"file_name": "Core elements of game play.png", "id": "908716783334316", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_908716786667649_9219195802101839858_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x5UKmnh-EYYQ7kNvwGYQaee&_nc_oc=AdoDWIj9vN_6v7szebjg39X4-CsFfvfebq_MPr9pOn_P9xOHcnzbu_mZTivgIgwmHlY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW2eL00WMiQAWHCXsZoTQqZtgPpVHkzSHiGuiJdcBV7-g&oe=6B103781"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Launch Video thumb meta.png", "id": "1295631934949726", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1295631938283059_3267256180983597643_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V9_NLwrU_1MQ7kNvwEHVRah&_nc_oc=AdpY5RzHx8khWml0jTZp9qBfXETKk_f5grxd5XE9tB41lOxpR0OiZzObxskfFc1Xmxc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUEZAkq4FgwKtHSSmwft1tBX_GX6sZegkaRvmBjH_iYOA&oe=6B103C33"}, "display_name": "Iron Rebellion", "keywords": ["mech", "shooter", "simulator", "tactical", "robot"], "long_description": "**\u201cSuperb and probably one of the BEST mech games in VR! - Think HAWKEN but better!\u201d\nParadise Decay Game Reviews** \n\nYOU\u2019RE THE PILOT\n\nReach for the throttle, bring your systems online, and aim your weapons. Learn the cockpit through a guided tutorial and then feel the weight of the machine as you move into combat.\n\nSOLO, OFFLINE, OR WITH OTHER PILOTS\n\n\nFight bots in every mode at your chosen difficulty to sharpen your skills, also available offline. Once you\u2019re ready, join live tactical 8v8 Warzone battles with other Quest and PCVR pilots.\n\n{1572799036680108}\n\nBUILD YOUR MACHINE\n\n\nSix mech classes offer different combat roles and handling. Configure weapons, install augments, and make your mech recognizable with camo customization.\n\nTHE EXPERIENCE\n\n\nFight across varied terrains and community-submitted maps. Read terrain elevation, use team pings, and track artillery impacts on your cockpit minimap. Watch live matches with Observer Mode\u2019s free-fly camera. Controller feedback and native bHaptics support add to the physical immersion.\n\n\n{1267730347693941}\n\nIN PLAYTESTING: FACTION WARS\n\n\nOur upcoming solo and cooperative PvE experience connects battles to faction territory and resource management, with a December release target. Owners of Iron Rebellion can join beta playtests and weekend campaigns through our official Discord.\n\nNote: Some features may change during development.\n\n\n{1114586743387378}\n\n{1180527426954687}\n", "short_description": "Climb into the cockpit of a 40-ton war machine. Built for VR, this mech simulator puts every switch, weapon, and system in your hands. Customize your mech, fight solo against bots, play offline, or face rival pilots in tactical 8v8 cross-platform combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.iron-rebellion.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Black Beach Studio, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.iron-rebellion.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED